    {
      "text": "the Lord will cause those who do wickedly to tremble and shake, D&C 10:56. heavens to shake for Saints’ good, D&C 21:6 (35:24). wickedness may speak with voice louder than that which shall shake earth, D&C 38:30. heavens shall shake, D&C 43:18 (45:48). continue looking forth for heavens to be shaken, D&C 49:23. elders to shake off dust of feet against those who reject them, D&C 60:15 (75:20). the Lord shakes not earth only, D&C 84:118. ask messenger from God to shake hands, D&C 129:4, 7–8. whatsoever things are not by the Lord shall be shaken, D&C 132:14.",
